James: "But mom, I was just getting to the best part."

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:49.440
Yes, it is a children's story but we find out later that the pirate Captain Flint is in fact a real person.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.320
And that the Treasure Planet is in fact a real place.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:56.420
